              "settings": {
                "tab_1_label": "Description",
                "tab_2_label": "Specifications",
                "tab_3_label": "Shipping & Returns",
                "tab_1_title": "Product Description",
                "tab_1_content": "<p>The Pro Elite BJJ Gi represents the pinnacle of martial arts apparel engineering. Crafted from premium 450gsm pearl weave cotton, this gi delivers exceptional durability while maintaining the flexibility essential for advanced techniques.<br/><br/>Features include reinforced stress points, traditional cut for optimal mobility, and pre-shrunk fabric to ensure consistent fit. The jacket features a classic lapel design with contrast stitching, while the pants include a drawstring waist and reinforced knees.<br/><br/>Perfect for training and competition, this gi meets all IBJJF regulations and comes with a satisfaction guarantee.<br/><br/></p>",
                "tab_2_title": "Specifications",
                "tab_2_content": "<p>Taekwondo Dobok – Precision, Discipline, and Power in Every Movement</p><p>Step onto the mats with unwavering focus and undeniable presence in the Antares Taekwondo Dobok. Designed for martial artists who train with discipline and compete with fire, this dobok is the perfect fusion of tradition, performance, and comfort. Whether you’re perfecting your poomsae or delivering explosive kicks in sparring, the White Flame is built to match your intensity with every move.</p><p>Crafted with lightweight yet durable materials, this dobok gives you the freedom to flow through your techniques while offering the structure needed for serious training. Clean lines, reinforced construction, and a sleek, traditional design make this dobok a go-to choice for both training and competition.</p>",
                "tab_3_title": "Shipping & Returns",
                "tab_3_content": "<p>The Pro Elite BJJ Gi represents the pinnacle of martial arts apparel engineering. Crafted from premium 450gsm pearl weave cotton, this gi delivers exceptional durability while maintaining the flexibility essential for advanced techniques.<br/><br/>Features include reinforced stress points, traditional cut for optimal mobility, and pre-shrunk fabric to ensure consistent fit. The jacket features a classic lapel design with contrast stitching, while the pants include a drawstring waist and reinforced knees.<br/><br/>Perfect for training and competition, this gi meets all IBJJF regulations and comes with a satisfaction guarantee.<br/><br/></p>",
                "active_tab_color": "#000000",
